WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes can feel longer than expected
when your attention keeps moving.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Begin with one free observation:
pick a comfortable focus point and set a timer.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
When your thoughts wander, notice and return.
That isn't failure.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 is an audio format: twelve levels,
four style choices at each level, the maker says.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The formats are described; promised automatic
brain changes still require independent evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the limits, compare the free route,
and decide for yourself.
